{"id":"wx2652796685","title":"今晨，华农这一幕刷屏！","published_at":"2024-10-01T12:29:30+08:00","published_label":"2024-10-01","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmfEliaQ1XkBHBx6YsMp7Y4PHM5mlpqUlsfYvpubmt6ibdLMXfdNTGk2JQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"今天 是中华人民共和国75周年华诞 华南农业大学 在行政楼广场隆重举行 升旗仪式 并开展 统一战线 “颂祖国、迎校庆”健步走 等系列庆祝活动 清晨，校党委书记李凤亮、党委副书记丁红星、副校长蒋育燕，校党委部门负责同志，统一战线代表及全校各单…","tags":["人物","活动"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652796685&idx=1&sn=eb063014ff0aac2baf1aa0c3ef7ff5cc","paper_url":null,"word_count":1625,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:48:40+08:00","content_html":"<div><p><span>今天</span></p><p><span>是中华人民共和国75周年华诞</span></p><p><span>华南农业大学</span></p><p><span>在行政楼广场隆重举行</span><span>升旗仪式</span></p><p><span>并开展</span><span>统一战线</span></p><p><span>“颂祖国、迎校庆”健步走</span></p><section><span>等系列庆祝活动</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmuJS9NrXAgpNlsoJjpIJ872e9O7icUOrBMsyibfwQNYvNwDYXddCSJvHw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmfBlp2V1ypxICW5ASMibaBeofjH2IFZNKDHwURO1H907OdQ51Dad3MRw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmC1iazmrSaY41ZKPlfaPXgJlkc6HAsdkBQmJ48cyXu66iaaSnypgicUFEg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>清晨，校党委书记李凤亮、党委副书记丁红星、副校长蒋育燕，校党委部门负责同志，统一战线代表及全校各单位共千余名师生，共同见证了五星红旗冉冉升起的庄严时刻。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmTSbcPP0riaibzyhx744EL5aeswx1n0GTjLIokZpoeByeb1LicWBfKQXBw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span><span>“今天，站在这鲜艳的五星红旗下，立足新中国75周年华诞的新起点，面对世界百年未有之大变局，面对国家和人民更高的期待，我们全体华农人要毫不动摇坚持和加强党的全面领导，把爱国情、强国志、报国行高度统一起来！”</span>李凤亮在讲话中回顾了新中国波澜壮阔的发展历程，指出华农办学115年来，始终坚守农业初心，与祖国同步伐、与人民共命运，谱写了爱国奉献、服务三农、立德树人、改革创新的壮丽凯歌。他</span><span>与全体师生共勉，希望华农教师将扎根“三农”、铸魂育人的责任写在奋斗的旗帜上，华农学子将“党有所呼，我有所应”“国有所需，我有所为”的誓言写在奋斗的旗帜上，共同为加快建成农业特色世界一流大学、助力农业强国和教育强国建设贡献力量。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmSKXeDBYqKsVpz90pl3XYDE1Cgwmx3jSZODafyia5YFR4AZoRoRxSrGA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>“广东省庆祝中华人民共和国成立75周年宣讲报告会”宣讲员、兽医学院2020级本科生邓志乐讲述了自己在向阳生长、追寻梦想的经历。“这些经历让我深深感恩祖国，正是有了祖国才有了现在的我。同时也让我明白，作为新时代的青年，我身上肩负着历史的使命，必须把个人理想与国家的未来紧密结合。”他号召同学们争做有理想、有本领、有担当的时代新人，到祖国最需要的地方去，以实际行动为中华民族的伟大复兴贡献力量。</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmsZ4TiaGTYib72e84by4rp4okfI3MGUCX8t4cYic51x4JbtcQuhLVVcoAw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmhY8mdyNXjHGn5TxZ96BgF3eCLwIe8E34qS1TOT8fbSsQB6VKyNPibxg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span>点击视频，听华农师生歌唱祖国！</span></section><section><span>伴随着小提琴和电钢琴的现场演奏，全体师生挥动手中的五星红旗，合唱了《我和我的祖国》和《歌唱祖国》，饱含爱国深情的悠扬歌声在广场上飘扬。<span>同学们还一起“花式”举牌</span><span>表白祖国，发出</span><span>“挺膺担当，强国有我！</span><span>”的新时代华农学子强音。</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmPwzQsXRjJzysiaGibeTibwq3P9nDN10R1YUQTZVJqGibvAJV4q3ZuQgdRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmgo0L2sNblhQ1YUYzIOunQzw6yiahLcPC4n2UstDcHjvTkj6AVh8LicPA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQm0sengpT0OMlfianlOW0sdEQkChCkI7XQ2DwrBQexQ9oOJWGGfiaZhxuQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmO8qaJic7SV25C51zLoKDFsnMKjxT0T1eicWmQsL99l9qXHX2z72boR4w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>与国旗合影</span></p><section><span>华南农业大学与清华大学等75所高校共同表白伟大祖国！</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>“颂祖国、迎校庆”健步走</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8ziaHJLkPF9DEibSWcLWbTDFxBpR2oiaeyySYgsHJrYDyk8c8h4j2XhPrZXCu1zz9WK6C466grVv42A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>升旗仪式后</span></p><p><span>华南农业大学统一战线</span></p><p><span>开展了“颂祖国、迎校庆”健步走活动</span></p><section><span>表达对祖国和母校的美好祝福</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmTATyjpBzJicf6fsRl8gHetaA6IBwRIQjeRaRqzkjW1NjIPlgHwMJLXg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQm3sw57LYhLeJhxibLarzaCW5pKu43x0T3UC94icPGQHEek4YTRWKvrGOg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span>李凤亮、丁红星和统一战线成员一起健步走</span></p><p><span>本次活动以学校<span>行政楼</span>广场为起点，途经毛主席题字石、校史展览馆、丁颖雕像、新校医院、院士广场、综合体育馆等校园地标建筑，最终回到行政楼广场，全程约4公里。途中设置多处打卡点、补给点和互动体验区，增强活动趣味性。</span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmM644OSbHmSYZiareGADErCF64VGNsolia2YgYgiaD8ylLS6g8C6OOuPpQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmWjw0zeVI7v09MNoCLQQAdqibASklXCUm74YdVx8Mh2wCDkCvaKl9VAQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8fPRA76ibOQaI2Mico4dIbQmiazicO1JeBf9iazbXnicejGf0dWWvWLVa1k3Qgxw37A54uURkgwT0Bklpw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>参加活动的老师们热情高涨、精神抖擞，前行的队伍宛如一条游动的长龙穿梭于紫荆校园，成为一道亮丽的风景线。</span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>国庆期间，</strong></p><p><strong>这么多主题活动，</strong><strong>别错过！</strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8ziaHJLkPF9DEibSWcLWbTDFxBpR2oiaeyySYgsHJrYDyk8c8h4j2XhPrZXCu1zz9WK6C466grVv42A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>据了解，国庆期间，华农还将举行系列庆祝活动。</span></p><p><strong><span>“忆初心、正当时”国庆爱国主义教育观影活动：</span></strong><span>10月1日至6日每晚7点，学校将在丁颖礼堂放映爱国影片，带领师生追忆峥嵘岁月，传承红色基因。</span></p><p><strong><span>各学院国庆主题系列活</span></strong><strong><span>动：</span></strong><span>各学院将结合学院实际，通过摄影、短视频、健康跑、游园会等同学们喜闻乐见的形式，举行内容丰富的庆祝活动，预计最长将持续至10月中旬。</span></p><section><strong><span> 点击了解活动预告详情→</span></strong><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMjEwMjYxMA==&amp;mid=26535